        "name": "Can you generate leads for destination weddings, banquets, and corporate conferences?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes! We build specialized high-converting landing pages and LinkedIn/Meta lead generation funnels targeting wedding planners, brides-to-be, and corporate HR directors for high-ticket lawn bookings and event catering."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How does local SEO help hotels rank in Google Maps?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "By optimizing your Google Business Profile with high-resolution photography, amenity tags (pool, spa, pet-friendly), managing guest reviews, and building local travel citations, we rank your property in the top 3 Google Map pack results for destination hotel searches."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How do you handle negative reviews on TripAdvisor and Google?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "We deploy automated post-stay review requests via WhatsApp to capture positive 5-star ratings from satisfied guests while providing immediate professional dispute resolution frameworks to de-escalate negative feedback."
        }
      },
