        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can you market boutique homestays, heritage villas, and luxury glamping resorts?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Yes! We tailor marketing angles to unique property USP factors—whether secluded nature serenity, private plunge pools, or heritage royal hospitality—targeting high-net-worth experiential travelers."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "How fast can a hotel marketing campaign launch?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "Our dedicated hospitality marketing team can set up landing pages, tracking pixels, Google Hotel Ads integration, and Meta campaigns ready to go live within 5 to 7 business days."
